  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Illusion sphere (Decoy (glamer), Mage Feint), base attack bonus +3.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may suppress two decoys surrounding you until the start of your next turn to use the Mage Feint talent as a swift action.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you possess the Weird Defense feat, you may end its effect instead of suppressing two decoys to use the Mage Feint talent as a swift action</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/combat-feats#toc93\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
